Amazon SageMaker User Guide Prerequisites for Amazon SageMaker Complete the following prerequisite tasks before you can set up Amazon SageMaker and proceed with the use cases in this guide. Topics • Sign up for an AWS account Sign up for an AWS account To get started with AWS, you need an AWS account. For information about creating an AWS account, see Getting started with an AWS account in the AWS Account Management Reference Guide. Sign up for an AWS account 7

