Amazon SageMaker User Guide • You can customize and inﬂuence model behavior using inference parameters and system prompts. For more information, see What is a prompt?. • You can enhance your chat agent app by adding data sources and guardrails. For more information, see Build a chat agent app. • You can share your chat agent app with other users and use it as a component in a ﬂows app. For more information, see Share a chat agent app and Deploy a chat agent app. • You can create a ﬂows app to link together diﬀerent components such as knowledge bases and reusable prompts. For more information, see Build a ﬂow app. Additional capabilities 38

