Amazon SageMaker User Guide API Documentation for Amazon SageMaker You can use the following guides to work with Amazon SageMaker programmatically: • SQL analytics • Amazon Redshift API reference • Data processing • Amazon EMR API reference • AWS Glue API reference • Amazon Athena API reference • Model development • Amazon SageMaker AI API reference • Gen AI app development • Amazon Bedrock API reference • Data and AI Governance • Amazon DataZone API Reference • SageMaker lakehouse architecture • Lake Formation API reference • Catalog objects API reference 62

